docs/build-https.md-14-
docs/build-https.md:15:`build_https` is an optional object in the machine configuration
docs/build-https.md-16-(`~/.curator/config.json`, or `CURATOR_CONFIG`). Each key is a scope and each
docs/build-https.md:17:value is one token-source selection. The configuration names where to read a
docs/build-https.md:18:token; it never contains a literal token.
docs/build-https.md-19-
docs/build-https.md-20-```json
docs/build-https.md-21-{
docs/build-https.md:22:  "build_https": {
docs/build-https.md-23-    "git.example.com": {
