docs/build-ssh.md-212-command is a usage error (exit 2) and not a failure attributed to the
docs/build-ssh.md-213-configuration file. It replaces whatever was recorded under the same scope and
docs/build-ssh.md-214-says which of the two it did:
docs/build-ssh.md-215-
docs/build-ssh.md-216-```console
docs/build-ssh.md:217:$ curator config build-ssh add git.example.com/portals --agent --identity ~/.ssh/id_ed25519.pub
